{"step_index":621,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-20T17:41:05Z","content":"{{ CHECKPOINT 7 }}\n **The earlier parts of this conversation have been truncated due to its long length. The following content summarizes the truncated context so that you may continue your work. **\n\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. thiết kế trang đầu chỉ là trang giới thiệu về kiến trúc số thôi\n2. mục này để làm gì\n3. bỏ trang tổng quan đi\n4. bỏ luôn trang này đi\n5. đã đưa hết lên nội dung file chưa\n6. phần thông tin khác đang bị chia ra quá nhiều\n7. phần hiện trạng và lộ trình có liên quan đến nhau ko\n8. nếu thêm liên kết chéo thì những phần nào sẽ đc liên kết và liên kết ra sao, dựa vào gì để liên kết\n9. vậy là hiện trạng sẽ hiện tổng hợp hết, còn bên lộ trình thì sẽ hiện những cái cần nâng cấp haowjc thay thế\n10. oke hãy làm theo phương án bạn đưa ra và liên kết nó đi\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n# Session Continuation Summary\n\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Implement Cross-linking between \"Hiện trạng\" and \"Lộ trình\"**\n  - **Status**: IMPLEMENTATION\n  - **User Intent**: \"oke hãy làm theo phương án bạn đưa ra và liên kết nó đi\" (Implement the proposed solution to link the Current Status systems with the Roadmap tasks).\n  - **Details**: The user wants to link `HeThongSo` (Digital Systems) and `NhiemVu` (Roadmap Tasks) so that users can see which Tasks are upgrading/replacing which Systems, and which Systems are affected by which Tasks. The backend schema and APIs are done; the UI needs to be updated.\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n- **Tech Stack Preference**: Permanent switch to **Next.js 14/15, Tailwind, Ant Design, Prisma, SQLite**.\n- **UI Distractions**: The user aggressively dislikes the Next.js Dev Overlay / Turbopack Indicator. It must remain hidden globally via CSS.\n- **GitHub Repository**: Code is actively pushed to `https://github.com/Ln0og/123.git` on the `main` branch.\n- **Data Source**: Original data comes from `C:\\Delta Force\\v4. ten mien - snnmt - bo_sung_CSDL_theo_ND278_15.9.2026 (1).xlsx`.\n- **Feature Removals (User Decisions)**: \n  - User requested completely removing the **Dashboard** (\"xóa luôn này và xóa cái trang dashboard đi\"). It is gone.\n  - User requested removing the **Tổng quan** page (\"bỏ trang tổng quan đi\"). It is gone.\n  - User requested removing the **Kiến trúc mục tiêu** page (\"bỏ luôn trang này đi\"). It is gone.\n  - User wanted the Homepage to be a pure introduction page (\"thiết kế trang đầu chỉ là trang giới thiệu về kiến trúc số thôi\"), so dynamic stats were removed from it.\n- **Data Import Completeness**: User demanded that ALL columns from their Excel file (Sharing capability, Frequency, Scope, Connection status) be imported, not just truncated fragments (\"đã đưa hết lên nội dung file chưa\").\n- **UI Bullet Points**: User noted that bulleted lists from Excel cells were splitting into separate rows (\"phần thông tin khác đang bị chia ra quá nhiều\"). Fixed by distinguishing literal `\\n` separators from actual cell newline characters.\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Fixed Popup Data Display**: Updated `(portal)/kts/hien-trang/page.tsx` to handle literal `\\n` characters from the DB correctly without splitting actual Excel cell multiline strings. Fixed a bug where URL links included concatenated text.\n- **Removed Dashboard, Tổng quan, and Kiến trúc mục tiêu**: Completely deleted `src/app/dashboard`, `src/app/api/dashboard`, `src/app/(portal)/kts/tong-quan`, and `src/app/(portal)/kts/muc-tieu`. Removed all navigational links to them across `src/app/page.tsx` and layout files.\n- **Redesigned Homepage**: Removed the dynamic metrics/stats section from `src/app/page.tsx` to make it a pure introductory landing page about the architectural framework.\n- **Generated Excel Template**: Wrote a Node script (`generate_template.js`) to create a blank `public/Mau_03_KhaiBao.xlsx` template and added a download button for it in `src/app/admin/import/page.tsx`.\n- **Re-imported Full Excel Data**: Rewrote `import_snn.js` to extract *all* columns (K-P) from the Excel file using a `Key::Value` format separated by literal `\\n`. Wiped old records and re-imported 379 systems without truncating text. \n- **Dynamic Popup Rendering**: Updated the `HeThongSo` modal to dynamically parse and render any `Key::Value` attributes stored in the `moTa` field.\n- **Started Cross-linking Feature (Backend)**: Added an N-N relation between `HeThongSo` and `NhiemVu` in `schema.prisma`. Successfully pushed schema to SQLite. Updated `app/api/he-thong/route.ts` and `app/api/nhiem-vu/route.ts` (and `[id]/route.ts`) to include and update these relations. Updated TS interfaces in `src/types/index.ts`.\n- **Version Control**: Pushed all aforementioned changes to the user's remote GitHub repository.\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Next.js Dev Indicator Override**: The indicator is successfully hidden via aggressive CSS in `src/app/globals.css` (`nextjs-portal { display: none !important; }`). Do not remove this CSS.\n- **Data Parsing Convention (`moTa`)**: Because SQLite doesn't natively support easy JSON array manipulation in Prisma, the extended attributes from Excel are stored in the `moTa` string field. They are formatted as `Key::Value` and separated by literal two-character strings `\\n` (not actual newline characters). The UI parses this dynamically using `.split(/\\\\n/)`.\n- **Cross-linking Schema**: \n  - `HeThongSo` has `nhiemVus: NhiemVu[] @relation(\"HeThongNhiemVu\")`.\n  - `NhiemVu` has `heThongSos: HeThongSo[] @relation(\"HeThongNhiemVu\")`.\n  - Next.js DEV server locked the query engine DLL during `prisma db push`, so the task had to be killed, schema generated, and server restarted. Next.js is currently running in background task-606.\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n**Edited Files:**\n- `src/app/page.tsx`: Removed Stats component, removed links to Dashboard, Tổng quan, and Mục tiêu. Updated spacing.\n- `src/app/(portal)/layout.tsx`: Removed nav items for Tổng quan, Mục tiêu, and Dashboard.\n- `src/app/admin/layout.tsx`: Removed Dashboard from sidebar menu.\n- `src/app/admin/page.tsx`: Changed root admin redirect from `/dashboard` to `/admin/he-thong`.\n- `src/app/admin/import/page.tsx`: Added a download button for `Mau_03_KhaiBao.xlsx`.\n- `generate_template.js` (NEW): Node script to generate the blank Excel template in the `public` folder.\n- `public/Mau_03_KhaiBao.xlsx` (NEW): The generated template.\n- `import_snn.js`: Modified to wipe old records, parse all columns without truncation, and format `moTa` using `Key::Value` and literal `\\n`.\n- `src/app/(portal)/kts/hien-trang/page.tsx`: Fixed URL extraction. Modified `renderModalContent` to dynamically parse `Key::Value` arrays split by `/\\\\n/`.\n- `prisma/schema.prisma`: Added `nhiemVus` and `heThongSos` Many-to-Many relations.\n- `src/app/api/he-thong/route.ts`: Added `include: { nhiemVus: true }`.\n- `src/app/api/nhiem-vu/route.ts` & `src/app/api/nhiem-vu/[id]/route.ts`: Handled `heThongSoIds` in POST/PUT requests using Prisma's `connect`/`set`. Included `heThongSos: true` in GET responses.\n- `src/types/index.ts`: Added `nhiemVus?: NhiemVuData[]` to `HeThongSoData` and `heThongSos?: HeThongSoData[]` to `NhiemVuData`.\n\n**Deleted Files/Directories:**\n- `src/app/dashboard/` and `src/app/api/dashboard/`\n- `src/app/(portal)/kts/tong-quan/`\n- `src/app/(portal)/kts/muc-tieu/`\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Current State**: The backend and types for the `HeThongSo` <-> `NhiemVu` cross-linking are completely done.\n- **Next Step 1 (Admin UI)**: Update `src/app/admin/nhiem-vu/page.tsx`. Add a field to the Task creation/editing Form (likely an Ant Design `<Select mode=\"multiple\">`) that fetches and displays all `HeThongSo` items, allowing the user to select which systems this task affects, and passing `heThongSoIds` to the API.\n- **Next Step 2 (Portal UI - Hiện trạng)**: Update the modal in `src/app/(portal)/kts/hien-trang/page.tsx`. If `selectedItem.nhiemVus` has items, display a new section (e.g., \"Dự án/Nhiệm vụ liên quan\") showing the tasks that are currently affecting this system and their progress.\n- **Next Step 3 (Portal UI - Lộ trình)**: Update the task list in `src/app/(portal)/kts/lo-trinh/page.tsx`. Under each task, if it links to systems (`heThongSos`), display tags indicating which systems are being targeted (e.g., \"Tác động đến: HT-01, HT-02\").\n- Note: Next.js dev server is running on `task-606`.\n\nYou have the 22 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789831851459]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/.user_uploaded/media_1789831851459.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T15:31:01Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789917998341]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/.user_uploaded/media_1789917998341.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-20T15:26:54Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789918138848]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/.user_uploaded/media_1789918138848.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-20T15:29:10Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789918337737]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/.user_uploaded/media_1789918337737.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-20T15:32:20Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789918457761]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/.user_uploaded/media_1789918457761.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-20T15:34:19Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789918657574]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/.user_uploaded/media_1789918657574.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-20T15:37:53Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789919437392]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/.